{"ticker":"TKO","updated":"2026-11-07T01:58:26Z","profile":{"longName":"TKO Group Holdings, Inc.","shortName":"TKO Group Holdings, Inc.","sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Entertainment","country":"United States","website":"https://tkogrp.com","fullTimeEmployees":4000,"marketCap":36022378496,"trailingPE":51.206432,"forwardPE":40.80098,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":6.499766,"pegRatio":1.62,"targetMeanPrice":231.63158,"targetHighPrice":250.0,"targetLowPrice":208.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":19,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.215,"earningsGrowth":1.859,"grossMargins":0.60322,"operatingMargins":0.30474,"profitMargins":0.05183,"totalRevenue":5542104064,"beta":0.65,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":226.94,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":170.14,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.67},"summary":"TKO Group Holdings, Inc. operates as a sports and entertainment company. The company operates through three segments: UFC, WWE and IMG. The UFC segment distributes programming content; ticket sales and site fees associated with the business's global live events; partnerships and marketing; and consumer products licensing agreements of UFC-branded products. The WWE segment consists of media rights fees associated with the distribution of its programming content; ticket sales and site fees associated with the business's global live events; partnerships and marketing; and consumer products licensing agreements of WWE-branded products. The IMG segment specializing in media rights management and sales, multi-channel content production and distribution, brand partnerships, strategic consulting, digital services, and event management. This segment also offers hospitality business, offering ticketing, curated guest experiences, live event production and travel management services. It is also involved in the merchandising of video games, apparel, equipment, trading cards, memorabilia, digital goods, and toys. In addition, the company engages in the sponsorships and advertising business, which offers sale of in-venue and in-broadcast advertising assets, content product integration, and digital impressions. The company was incorporated in 2023 and is based in New York, New York. TKO Group","summary_zh":"TKO Group Holdings, Inc. 是一家體育和娛樂公司。該公司透過三個部門運作：UFC、WWE 和 IMG。 UFC 部分分發節目內容；與公司全球現場活動相關的門票銷售和場地費用；合作夥伴關係和行銷； UFC 品牌產品的消費產品授權協議。 WWE 部分包括與其節目內容分發相關的媒體版權費；與公司全球現場活動相關的門票銷售和場地費用；合作夥伴關係和行銷；以及 WWE 品牌產品的消費產品授權協議。 IMG 部門專注於媒體版權管理和銷售、多通路內容製作和發行、品牌合作夥伴關係、策略諮詢、數位服務和活動管理。該部門也提供飯店業務，提供票務、策劃的賓客體驗、現場活動製作和旅遊管理服務。它還涉及影片遊戲、服裝、設備、交易卡、紀念品、數位產品和玩具的銷售。此外，該公司還從事贊助和廣告業務，提供場內和廣播內廣告資產的銷售、內容產品整合和數位印象。該公司成立於2023年，總部位於紐約州紐約市。將軍澳集團","sector_zh":"通訊服務","industry_zh":"娛樂","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-08","o":194.66,"h":200.71,"l":194.56,"c":200.47,"v":1098300},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":198.46,"h":198.78,"l":192.84,"c":196.43,"v":794800},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":197.51,"h":197.51,"l":193.22,"c":195.13,"v":601800},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":195.14,"h":203.17,"l":194.97,"c":202.24,"v":977000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":201.76,"h":204.1,"l":200.7,"c":202.44,"v":897100},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":206.51,"h":212.49,"l":200.96,"c":204.49,"v":2302200},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":204.23,"h":204.23,"l":199.84,"c":200.29,"v":3258900},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":203.66,"h":204.1,"l":200.4,"c":201.38,"v":1933700},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":202.48,"h":203.41,"l":200.0,"c":202.8,"v":1320100},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":202.29,"h":203.36,"l":200.98,"c":201.11,"v":2052700},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":200.31,"h":201.26,"l":197.51,"c":199.67,"v":1661400},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":200.0,"h":202.84,"l":199.67,"c":202.29,"v":1831100},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":202.0,"h":202.98,"l":195.68,"c":195.79,"v":1958800},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":195.99,"h":196.57,"l":194.66,"c":195.79,"v":912600},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":196.57,"h":200.02,"l":196.19,"c":199.04,"v":1008200},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":200.55,"h":206.27,"l":198.91,"c":205.33,"v":1837600},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":205.49,"h":208.48,"l":201.77,"c":201.96,"v":3160600},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":200.08