"src":"Dealroom","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxOOVBQNDlBVWgyeDVPYWF5djJTeWFtZ2o4TXZ2alpBV1dpTGllOU55S3VsVkJRWHZlUGlZc3FSSlJSLWJXQ2RRWGZ6SXBDOTF5cXJkTVp1QUQ3LVFyNlYtS1RBZFNSQWxVdFBaTUtxSXFXNnFkUnYyZG1NWFVFTnB2NGJma3RPRUU4WmZWdmxrZHd3SHBl?oc=5","date":"2026-11-05","zh":"TKO 推出 10 億美元擔保票據銷售，為股票回購提供資金"},{"title":"Guggenheim raises TKO Group stock price target on guidance lift","src":"Investing.com","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxOdHJRWXhFak84SldxVElwdWR5UjFHNU5kckgteTgydXg0SEtadE1sMTNWWE1PS1RGNTljLTQ2RHI4ZDRjeG43ZnBNY3BSSnZ1XzJTcG5wcDFxWDk4RkRFQXR2amdoamNFRjc5Y1FmWm40bWhaM1BHZy16bktQU1JLTTkzNGRsV0p4R0FVZUtTQU4xNVpNbjQ3ZzRhcTdabDlXM2tmV2hUSDNYRTV0eWZxTHRzazJiQ09wY3YzaG9jRmY?oc=5","date":"2026-11-05","zh":"古根漢因指引提升而上調 TKO 集團股價目標"},{"title":"TKO Addresses WWE WrestleMania 43 Saudi Arabia Deal Amid Relocation Questions","src":"Wrestlezone","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-11-05","zh":"TKO 解決 WWE WrestleMania 43 沙烏地阿拉伯協議中的搬遷問題"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":8},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":2},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":2},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2},{"name":"併購","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-25","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1973266/000119312526071651/tko-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"TKO is a premium sports and entertainment company. TKO's businesses include UFC, the world's premier mixed martial arts (\"MMA\") organization; WWE, the global leader in sports entertainment; Professional Bull Riders (\"PBR\"), the world's premier bull riding organization; and its joint venture Zuffa Boxing, a professional boxing promotion. Together, these properties reach more than 1 billion households across 210 countries and territories and organize more than 500 live events year-round, attracting more than three million fans. TKO also services and partners with major sports rights holders through IMG, an industry-leading global sports marketing agency; and On Location, a global leader in premium experiential hospitality.","zh":null},{"en":"TKO was initially established through the combination of UFC and WWE in September 2023. The combination of these two businesses united two complementary sports and sports entertainment properties in a single company. We significantly expanded our portfolio on February 28, 2025, when we completed the Endeavor Asset Acquisition, pursuant to which we acquired the IMG business, including certain businesses operating under the IMG brand, On Location, and PBR (collectively, the \"Acquired Businesses\") from EGH and its subsidiaries. The transaction was valued at approximately $3.25 billion plus a $50 million purchase price adjustment (based on the volume-weighted average sales price of TKO's Class A common stock for the twenty-five trading days ending on October 23, 2024), and was satisfied through the issuance of 26.54 million common units of TKO OpCo and an equivalent number of corresponding s","zh":null},{"en":"We believe TKO's businesses are well-positioned among sports, media and entertainment peers given our comprehensive portfolio of premium intellectual property, global media distribution capabilities, and experiential offerings. The addition of IMG, a global leader in sports, events, and media, and On Location, a premium experiential hospitality provider for marquee global events, significantly expands our engagement with our global fanbase. Finally, PBR provides us with additional live event programming and media content. In total, our combined portfolio allows us to engage fans across the entire sports ecosystem, from media consumption to premium live event experiences.","zh":null}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The entertainment and sports services industries are highly competitive and subject to fluctuations in popularity, which are not easy to predict. For our live event and media content audiences, we face competition from professional and college sports (including other MMA promotions), scripted wrestling promotions, other live, filmed, televised, and streamed entertainment, as well as other leisure activities. We continue to face increased competition from websites, mobile, and other internet-connected apps delivering paid and free content as streamed media offerings continue to expand.","zh":null},{"en":"With the addition of the IMG business and On Location, we now also compete in the highly fragmented markets for sports representation and experiential hospitality. We face competition from other global sports marketing agencies and premium hospitality providers that compete for rights holders and corporate clients.","zh":null}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"World Wrestling Entertainment","val":1709395000,"zh":"World Wrestling Entertainment"},{"name":"Ultimate Fighting Championship","val":1502161000,"zh":"Ultimate Fighting Championship"},{"name":"IMG","val":1367259000,"zh":"IMG"}],"total":4735151000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Media Rights Production & Content","val":2605116000,"zh":"Media Rights Production & Content"},{"name":"Live Events & Hospitality","val":1339456000,"zh":"Live Events & Hospitality"},{"name":"Partnerships & Marketing","val":588516000,"zh":"Partnerships & Marketing"},{"name":"Consumer Products Licensing & Other","val":244789000,"zh":"Consumer Products Licensing & Other"}],"total":4735151000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"North America","val":3514848000,"zh":"North America"},{"name":"EMEA","val":898150000,"zh":"EMEA"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":241672000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Latin America","val":80481000,"zh":"Latin America"}],"total":4735151000}},"peers":["SPHR","FLUT","FWONK","MSGS","CART"]}}